{"seq":2,"slug":"the-soul","title":"The Soul","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/the-soul","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-tripartite-soul","title":"灵魂三分","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/the-soul/the-tripartite-soul","wordCount":2005,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"immortality-of-the-soul","title":"灵魂不朽","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/ideas-and-methods/the-soul/immortality-of-the-soul","wordCount":1899,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现柏拉图的灵魂学说。\"灵魂三分\"主张，灵魂由理性、激情、欲望三部分构成，各有其德性；而正义，便在于三部分各司其职、由理性主导、和谐有序——这深刻地洞察了人的内心结构与冲突。\"灵魂不朽\"则论证灵魂在肉体死亡后继续存在，并与理念论、伦理学紧密交织。本章揭示柏拉图对人类心灵与命运的深刻思考。\n"}